<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the final</p>
<p>day of four-day Red Stripe Cup cricket matches on Monday:</p>
<p>In Port of Spain: Trinidad and Tobago beat the Windward</p>
<p>Islands by four wickets. Trinidad and Tobago 302 and 80-6.</p>
<p>Windward Islands 140 and 238 (J.Silvester 66, B.Watt 57; Mukesh</p>
<p>Persad 4-55).</p>
<p>In Bridgetown: Barbados beat Guyana by 10 wickets. Guyana</p>
<p>156 and 294 (C.Lambert 145, A.Percival 91). Barbados 448-8</p>
<p>declared and 4-0.</p>
</text>
